# Sun City Summerlin - Development Rules

## 🎯 Project Context
- **Stack:** Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS 4
- **Focus:** Real estate website for Dr. Jan Duffy, REALTOR®
- **Community:** Sun City Summerlin, Las Vegas' premier 55+ active adult community
- **SEO Priority:** Local SEO, Google Business Profile integration, WCAG AA compliance

## 🚫 Accessibility - Color Contrast (WCAG AA)

### CRITICAL: Never Use These Combinations
- ❌ `text-accent` (#C9A962 champagne gold) on light backgrounds → Use `text-[#1C1917]` (ink)
- ❌ `bg-accent` for buttons with white text → Use `bg-[#1C1917]`
- ❌ Light text on light backgrounds

### ✅ Correct Patterns
```tsx
// Text on light background
<span className="text-[#1C1917] font-bold">${price}</span>  // ✅
<span className="text-[#C9A962]">${price}</span>            // ❌

// Buttons
<button className="bg-[#1C1917] text-white">Click</button>  // ✅
<button className="bg-[#C9A962] text-white">Click</button>  // ❌ (low contrast)

// Icons
<ChevronDown className="w-5 h-5 text-[#1C1917]" />         // ✅
```

### Color Usage Rules
- **Primary (#1C1917 ink):** Text on light backgrounds, button backgrounds, links, icons
- **Accent (#C9A962 champagne):** Decorative elements on dark backgrounds, hover accents
- **Background (#F7F6F4 cool ivory):** Section backgrounds
- **Text (#141210 near black):** Body text
- **Fonts:** Outfit (body), Cormorant Garamond (headings) — via next/font in layout.tsx

## 🎯 Touch Target Sizes (WCAG AA)

### Requirement
All interactive elements MUST be minimum 44x44px (11 Tailwind units = `h-11 w-11`)

### Implementation
```tsx
// ✅ Correct
<button className="min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] ...">
<Link className="min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] ...">
```

## 📝 ARIA Attributes

### aria-expanded
**MUST use string values, not boolean:**
```tsx
// ✅ Correct
aria-expanded={isOpen ? 'true' : 'false'}

// ❌ Incorrect
aria-expanded={isOpen}  // Boolean, causes linter error
```

## 🏗️ Next.js 15 App Router Patterns

### Server vs Client Components
- **Default:** Server Components (no `'use client'`)
- **Use `'use client'` ONLY for:** useState, useEffect, event handlers, browser APIs

### Metadata & SEO
Every page MUST include:
```tsx
export const metadata: Metadata = {
  title: "Page Title | Sun City Summerlin | Las Vegas",
  description: "Description including 'Sun City Summerlin,' '55+,' and 'Las Vegas'",
  alternates: {
    canonical: "https://www.suncityvegas.com/page-path",
  },
  openGraph: {
    title: "Page Title | Sun City Summerlin",
    url: "https://www.suncityvegas.com/page-path",
    siteName: "Sun City Summerlin Homes for Sale | Dr. Jan Duffy",
  },
}
```

**Required keywords in descriptions:**
- "Sun City Summerlin" (community name)
- "55+" or "active adult community"
- "Las Vegas" (location)
- "Dr. Jan Duffy" (when relevant)

### Dynamic Routes
```tsx
// Params are Promises in Next.js 15!
export async function generateMetadata({
  params,
}: {
  params: Promise<{ slug: string }>;
}) {
  const { slug } = await params
  // ...
}
```

## 🖼️ Image Optimization

### Always Use Next.js Image Component
```tsx
import Image from 'next/image'

<Image
  src="/images/hero/hero-bg.jpg"
  alt="Descriptive alt text"  // REQUIRED
  fill  // For background images
  priority  // For above-fold images
  placeholder="blur"
  blurDataURL={blurDataURL}
  sizes="100vw"
/>
```

## 🔍 SEO Requirements

### Every Page Must Have
- [ ] Unique title with location/keywords
- [ ] Meta description with "Sun City Summerlin," "55+," "Las Vegas"
- [ ] Canonical URL (always `https://www.suncityvegas.com`)
- [ ] OpenGraph tags
- [ ] Twitter card
- [ ] Proper H1 heading
- [ ] Descriptive image alt text
- [ ] Relevant structured data

### URL Format
- **Base URL:** `https://www.suncityvegas.com`
- **Always use www subdomain**
- **Always use HTTPS**

## 🧪 Testing Checklist

Before committing:
- [ ] Color contrast ratios (4.5:1 normal text, 3:1 large text)
- [ ] Touch targets are 44x44px minimum
- [ ] ARIA attributes use string values
- [ ] All images have descriptive alt text
- [ ] Metadata includes required keywords
- [ ] Canonical URLs are correct
- [ ] Structured data is valid

## 🚨 Common Mistakes to Avoid

- ❌ Using `text-accent` on light backgrounds
- ❌ Using `bg-accent` for buttons
- ❌ Missing `min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px]` on custom buttons
- ❌ Using boolean for `aria-expanded`
- ❌ Forgetting `'use client'` when using hooks
- ❌ Missing canonical URLs
- ❌ Generic meta descriptions without location/keywords
- ❌ Missing alt text on images
- ❌ Using `<img>` instead of Next.js `<Image>`
